>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Single-point calculation on the original coordinates and ligand-by-ligand Lewis review. Each ibuprofenate contains H17, Both retain carboxylate groups. The other two hydrogen-free O atoms form a direct O–O bond in the given coordinates. Use a donor limiting form with neutral O₂ and Zn(II), This balances the two carboxylates; The graph leaves the local spin of O₂ unspecified. Localized 12 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths. Use the supplied Lewis representation for scoring; Independent evidence for the complete graph is limited.

